    "date": "2021-11-06T02:08:21+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "First time to visit this warm spring. All morning to myself. About 15 miles east of Brawley in the desert.\n\n32.95143° N, 115.28442° W\n\nQuite remarkable. \nAn oasis in the desert.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 1163,
    "date": "2021-11-07T19:29:01+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "This is an undeveloped public access warm spring.\n\nDown south about 15 kilometers is a hot spring, free public access, more developed, much greater and hotter output. \n\nI can visit both in one day.  This is Imperial Valley, most of it is below sea level.",
