    "text": "Should I bore you with campsite photos? All basically the same now that I have acquired my gear, just the tree arrangements change.  This is a wonderful tree in a wonderful location to use once or twice a week. \n\nI leave few things behind to establish my territory and to see if anyone has been there to touch them.\n\nThe junkies will go through every and steal anything of value. \n\nHere is the view below.  The campsite is within the limits of a Brawley city park.   The dirty bathroom is only opened occasionally.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 1233,
    "date": "2021-11-17T20:02:32+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "",
    "media": "1233.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 1234,
    "date": "2021-11-17T20:05:36+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "The city of Brawley and people throughout the Imperial Valley had a holiday weekend at the rodeo. Very All American Christian event, with most everyone carrying a gun.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 1235,
    "date": "2021-11-17T20:05:55+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "",
    "media": "1235.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 1236,
    "date": "2021-11-17T20:05:55+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "",
    "media": "1236.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 1237,
